  - title: LEVEL 26 | NUMBERED WIRING | 10 CONNECTIONS
    explanation: 1 Battery_positive -> SwitchInput; 2 SwitchOutput -> D_BRIDGE_1_Anode;
      3 SwitchOutput -> D_BRIDGE_3_Cathode; 4 Battery_negative -> D_BRIDGE_2_Anode;
      5 Battery_negative -> D_BRIDGE_4_Cathode; 6 D_BRIDGE_1_Cathode -> R_LIMIT_Input;
      7 D_BRIDGE_2_Cathode -> R_LIMIT_Input; 8 R_LIMIT_Output -> LED_Anode; 9 LED_Cathode
      -> D_BRIDGE_3_Anode; 10 LED_Cathode -> D_BRIDGE_4_Anode. In your last reported
      layout D1=Slot_02, D3=Slot_03, D2=Slot_04, D4=Slot_05.
    caption: PAGE 2/4 | FOLLOW TERMINAL NAMES, NOT VISUAL ORIENTATION
