  - title: LEVEL 26 | CONDUCTING DIODES
    explanation: 'Correct path: battery+ -> switch -> D1 -> 220 ohm resistor -> green
      LED -> D4 -> battery-. D2 and D3 are reverse-biased. Do not directly wire battery-
      to LED cathode or switch output to battery-. Those connections bypass the intended
      bridge load.'
    caption: PAGE 3/4 | NORMAL 5 V POLARITY | D1 AND D4 CONDUCT
